{
  "format": "pinmame-harness-scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Boot an NBA S.A.M. ROM from an empty NVRAM with four balls on trough switches 18-21, insert four coins and press Start, let the team-selection screen time out, then model one served ball (18 opens, shooter lane 23 closes and opens), a left-orbit hit, both lower flipper buttons, a ball in each eject hole (35 and 9), the three MVP drop targets going down and the basket opto. Every switch write is a host stimulus; the observations are the public outputs that change after each step. The scenario names no driver.",
